        "图 11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们不用数轴来证明这个定理。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "研究差 $(a+c)-(b+c)$。有：$(a+c)-(b+c)=a-b$。",
        "因为 $a<b$，所以差 $a-b$ 为负，这就是说，差 $(a+c)-(b+c)$ 为",
        "负。于是，",
        "$a+c<b+c$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，真不等式两边加上同一数，结果仍是真不等式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "推论　真不等式中任何一项加上相反的符号从一边移到",
        "另一边，结果仍是真不等式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "实际上，",
        "$(a+b<c)\\Longrightarrow[a+b+(-b)<c+(-b)]$",
        "$\\Longrightarrow(a<c-b)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "定理 2　如果 $a<b$，$c$ 是正数，那么 $ac<bc$。如果",
        "$a<b$，$c$ 是负数，那么 $ac>bc$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了证明这个定理，我们把差 $ac-bc$ 变形成积：",
        "$ac-bc=c(a-b)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为 $a<b$，所以 $a-b$ 是负数。当 $c$ 是正数时，积 $c(a-↵b)$ 为负，于是，差 $ac-bc$ 为负，即 $ac<bc$。当 $c$ 是负数时，积",
        "$c(a-b)$ 为正，这就是说，差 $ac-bc$ 为正，即 $ac>bc$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，真不等式两边乘以同一个正数，结果仍是真不等",
        "式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "真不等式两边乘以同一个负数，并把不等号变向，结果仍",
        "是真不等式。"
      ]
    },
    {
